@startuml
title ERS Login — Authentication Is Account-Level

actor User
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "Authentication API" as AuthAPI
database "auth_user_accounts" as Accounts
database "auth_sessions" as Sessions

User -> Browser : Enter login + password
Browser -> AuthAPI : POST /auth/login

AuthAPI -> Accounts : Find Authentication Account
Accounts --> AuthAPI : Account

AuthAPI -> AuthAPI : Verify password
AuthAPI -> AuthAPI : Verify account.active

alt invalid credentials / inactive Account
  AuthAPI --> Browser : 401 Unauthorized
else valid Account
  AuthAPI -> Sessions : Create Account-level Session
  Sessions --> AuthAPI : sessionId
  AuthAPI --> Browser : Session cookie / login result
end

note over AuthAPI,Sessions
Session authenticates the Account.

It does NOT permanently select
one Actor for all Tenants.
end note

@enduml